WEBVTT

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:08.050
An atmosphere like the top-class
resorts of Europe is very alluring!

00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:11.220
The water temperature is always
close to body temperature,

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:16.470
making it an all-weather indoor water
leisure land that can be enjoyed year-round!

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:17.970
Here we are!

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:20.560
So exciting!

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:26.440
Yeah. Thanks for the description, Tohsaka.

00:01:36.390 --> 00:01:37.800
Yahoo!

00:01:38.850 --> 00:01:39.850
Shirou!

00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:47.480
Th-There's water in my ear!

00:01:47.860 --> 00:01:49.270
Oh hey, sorry!

00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:51.320
This is unbelievable, Rin!

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:54.530
Who would've thought we
could go river rafting indoors?

00:01:55.030 --> 00:01:58.950
I hear that the Fujiyama Slide over
there is twice as long as this one!

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:00.200
Is that so?

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:02.620
We can't just sit around here, then!

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:04.540
Let's get going, Shirou!

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:06.890
Hey! Hold up, you two!

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:06.890
<i>Today,</i>

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:11.340
<i>the three of us, Saber,
Tohsaka and I are at the Shinto Pool.</i>

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:15.130
<i>Originally, Fuji-nee was supposed to come,</i>

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:19.050
<i>but since she had scheduling issues with her friends,</i>

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:21.140
<i>she gave us her tickets</i>

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:23.100
<i>when we happened to be there.</i>

00:02:44.410 --> 00:02:45.950
Saber! Above you! Above you!

00:02:58.050 --> 00:03:00.550
Oh, I couldn't stop laughing!

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:03.180
Here. I went out and got us these.

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:04.310
Thanks!

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:07.310
Okay, we're gonna take a break,
and then we're heading back in to swim!

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:09.940
Is there anywhere you want to go, Saber?

00:03:10.270 --> 00:03:13.820
I'd like to give river rafting another try!

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:18.950
Sounds good! There are other slides
we haven't tried yet, so let's head over!

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:22.120
I also want to try diving,

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:25.290
and I really want to know
what this Fountain Park's about.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:28.120
What is it, Shirou?

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:32.250
No, I was just thinking that you look
like you're enjoying yourself, Tohsaka.

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:34.170
Well, of course I'm enjoying myself!

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:36.170
I always do what I'm supposed to do,

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:38.470
so you'd better believe I'm gonna have fun at full blast!

00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:39.470
Shirou?

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:41.300
Rider?

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:44.390
Oh, and it's Rin and Saber.

00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:46.600
What are you doing here, Rider?

00:03:46.850 --> 00:03:48.560
I come here a lot actually.

00:03:48.810 --> 00:03:50.640
Like when I want to get some exercise.

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:53.400
I've made up my mind!

00:03:53.860 --> 00:03:55.650
About what? All of a sudden...

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:57.400
About where we're going next!

00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:00.280
We can do it if there's four of us!

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:03.410
Here!

00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:04.580
Rin!

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:06.740
Take that!

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:07.620
No sweat!

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:09.540
Nice!

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:10.960
Oh no, you don't!

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:16.300
All right! We scored first!

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:19.670
I guess having you on the team gives us an edge, Rider!

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:22.800
I suppose so. Since I'm so tall.

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:26.140
Dammit! We can't always be on the losing end!

00:04:26.390 --> 00:04:27.510
Let's win this, Saber!

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:29.350
Right! Of course!

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:33.520
Easier said than done, right?

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:34.770
<i>So anyway,</i>

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:39.440
<i>the four of us started out enjoying
a game of beach volleyball, but...</i>

00:04:42.070 --> 00:04:42.990
Shirou!

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:45.240
<i>How did I end up like this?</i>

00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:49.950
<i>I've seen those hulking guys somewhere before.
What are they doing here?</i>

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:48.870
All right! That's one point!

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:51.790
If you can't do that, then don't bother.

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:52.870
<i>I mean, when did they join the game?</i>

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:56.790
Listen to you! Getting all worked up
when you're playing against humans!

00:04:57.040 --> 00:04:58.880
Don't you think you're being immature?

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:00.420
That's where you're wrong, Rin.

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:02.130
No matter what kind of contest it is,

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:05.140
you'd be dissing your opponent
if you pulled your punches.

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:09.770
Of course, if the King of Knights were
to request that I go easy on them,

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:11.390
it would be a different story.

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:14.440
Fine by me.

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:18.770
Since we're playing against Servants,
there's no reason to hold back.

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:22.070
Looks like Saber's motivated!

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:24.950
Wouldn't have it any other way.

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:39.590
Shirou, toss it up!

00:05:40.090 --> 00:05:40.800
R-Right!

00:05:44.050 --> 00:05:44.970
<i>There!</i>

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:48.100
As if!

00:05:49.220 --> 00:05:50.510
Good pass!

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:56.310
Damn, I missed.

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:57.940
My bad.

00:05:58.190 --> 00:05:59.270
That wasn't on purpose.

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:00.730
Liar!

00:06:01.110 --> 00:06:02.690
Based on what grounds?

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:02.690
How heinous.

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:05.400
You just said you missed, remember?

00:06:03.320 --> 00:06:05.400
You totally aimed for his face!

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:06.740
Curse you!

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:08.990
Not done yet!

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:14.250
It's over!

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:19.790
Victory!

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:24.170
This is no longer a game, is it?

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:26.930
Just watching makes my blood boil!

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:31.510
Damn those guys! Did they forget I'm not a Servant?

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:33.180
You...

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:35.770
This may be a game, but a challenge is a challenge!

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:37.980
To lose in this manner is disgraceful for a knight!

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:38.940
Saber?

00:06:38.270 --> 00:06:39.650
This isn't over yet!

00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:42.110
Let's battle them one more time, Shirou!

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:47.610
So exhausted!

00:06:48.360 --> 00:06:49.990
Now I can't move!

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:52.790
I played like there was no tomorrow!

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:55.120
You were so fired up, Saber.

00:06:55.120 --> 00:06:57.540
All we did was play beach volleyball after all.

00:06:57.830 --> 00:07:00.000
I'm sorry. I do feel bad about that.

00:07:00.790 --> 00:07:03.710
Hey, but I'm glad we got to go, aren't you?

00:07:04.050 --> 00:07:07.340
You're right. We do need to have
days like this once in a while.

00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:10.340
How about you, Saber? Did you have fun?

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:12.140
Yes, a lot of fun!

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:14.600
Now, then...

00:07:14.890 --> 00:07:17.060
I'm gonna get dinner started now.

00:07:17.310 --> 00:07:19.100
You guys think you can eat?

00:07:20.980 --> 00:07:23.820
I'm so tired that I don't have an appetite.

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:28.150
Okay! Gotcha!

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:36.330
Shirou, the barley tea's right here.

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:38.540
No, this is broth.

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:40.420
I made some ahead of time.

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:43.210
Th-That's our Shirou.

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:45.500
I'm gonna use this for dinner.

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:48.550
I think you'll be able to eat even
if you don't have an appetite.

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:51.220
Do you want me to help, too?

00:07:51.890 --> 00:07:53.050
That's okay.

00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:55.970
It won't take long. You can just take it easy there.

00:07:56.310 --> 00:08:00.100
Then I'll take you up on that and leave it all to you.

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:02.100
You're melting, Rin.

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:11.860
First, you slice some Japanese ginger
and ginger as finely as possible.

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:18.250
Then, you debone the salmon and shred the flesh.

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:19.410
Hot, hot!

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:21.870
And then,

00:08:22.370 --> 00:08:25.250
squeeze some cucumbers you've soaked in salt water.

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:27.800
Rinse them off under water.

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:29.800
Then, lightly squeeze out the water.

00:08:31.180 --> 00:08:33.090
This should be okay for Tohsaka.

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:36.640
It won't be enough for Saber and me,

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:39.350
so I guess I should make a few more dishes.

00:08:41.560 --> 00:08:42.480
All right!

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:43.980
Dinner's ready! Both of you—

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:46.270
Huh?

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:01.660
Hey, there you are!

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:03.500
Shirou...

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:06.540
Sorry about that. The breeze felt so good.

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:08.340
Is dinner ready?

00:09:09.300 --> 00:09:10.090
Yeah.

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:14.220
I guess we might as well eat out here, huh?

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:17.970
There you go! Chilled ochazuke.

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:25.520
You pour cold broth or tea over cold rice.

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:29.530
Oh, I think I can manage to eat this.

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:38.700
Delicious!

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:41.410
It tastes so refreshing, and it's so easy to eat!

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:44.080
Yes. That's a fine-tasting broth.

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:49.670
I've got shredded salmon, Japanese ginger,
ginger, salted kelp, sesame miso...

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:53.340
There are all kinds of stuff,
so mix in whatever you want, okay?

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:56.930
On hotter days, this would taste great with ice in it.

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:00.970
I finished it!

00:10:02.770 --> 00:10:03.930
Glad to hear it.

00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:06.440
I wasn't lying when I said I had no appetite!

00:10:06.850 --> 00:10:09.650
Tohsaka, there's still enough left for seconds.

00:10:13.990 --> 00:10:14.950
Seconds, please.

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:16.570
Me, too, Shirou.

00:10:16.990 --> 00:10:17.910
Roger that!

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:21.330
This sesame miso tastes pretty good, too!

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:23.080
So does the salted kelp!

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:26.170
I'm gonna add a lot of Japanese ginger and ginger.

00:10:26.170 --> 00:10:28.250
Now I want to try it with green tea.

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:29.840
So a third bowl for me?

00:10:33.260 --> 00:10:35.220
Now I'm stuffed!

00:10:36.050 --> 00:10:38.180
Have you regained some strength?

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:41.430
Yes, now that I've eaten, I feel better.

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:42.770
All right, Shirou!

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:45.730
Just give me a massage, and I'll make a full recovery!

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:47.020
What?

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:50.400
Come on! One more push!

00:10:53.860 --> 00:10:56.110
All right, all right! I'll do it!

00:10:56.360 --> 00:10:58.740
Yay! I'm counting on you!
